# Reed bed in the shallows: ~26 stalks, back ones G, front ones g, with
# j/G leaf thickening low down and a dense j clump on the water line (the
# sprite bottom), five O/l cattail heads on the tall stalks; sparse at the
# top and at most 2 tiles tall, so a Gelse above it stays readable. No k
# (vegetation). idle: the upper part of the stalks sways 1 px right.
# Front-layer prop.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grids are the source.
sprite = schilf
size   = 48x32
origin = 24,32
anim   = idle frames=2 ticks=30 loop
